OL,3,APolice fire tear gas at crowds as tens
OL,4,Aof thousands join school demonstrations
OL,5,Ain France
OL,6,
OL,7,FTens of thousands of people are
OL,8,Fdemonstrating across France, in protest
OL,9,Fat what they say is under-investment in
OL,10,Fhigh schools
OL,12,FOne union says 2,000 high schools have
OL,13,Fclosed - France's interior ministry
OL,14,Festimated earlier there were 86,000
OL,15,Fprotesters across the country, not
OL,16,Fincluding Paris
OL,18,FPolice have fired tear gas in the
OL,19,Fcapital and in Marseille - our reporter
OL,20,Fthere says he can "feel it in my throat
OL,21,Fand eyes"
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
