OL,3,APolice fire tear gas at crowds as tens
OL,4,Aof thousands join school demonstrations
OL,5,Ain France
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Lyon, a barricade was set on fire;
OL,8,Fwhile in Rennes, police used water
OL,9,Fcannon. In Paris, one 17-year-old tells
OL,10,Fus she studies in "overcrowded" classes
OL,11,Fof 35
OL,13,FIn parliament, French Prime Minister
OL,14,FSebastian Lecornu says: "Burning down a
OL,15,Fhigh school does not improve the state
OL,16,Fof high school buildings"
